# Theme authoring

Cursor is **recommended** for this repo (not required). This repo is the **full
default theme**: every layout, partial, component and page is present.

## Docs

- **Live (authoritative):** https://b2bware.documentationai.com/advanced/storefront-themes
- **Changelog:** https://b2bware.documentationai.com/changelog
- **Bundled (offline / AI context):** start at `theme/docs/README.md` (load matrix).
  Always also load `theme/docs/hard-rules.md`. Usually load `theme/docs/view-data.md`.

## Stale forks

Before trusting bundled docs on an old clone: open the live changelog, or run
`./scripts/update-theme-docs.sh` (pulls topic pages from the public wiki — never
overwrites your Blade/CSS/`theme.json`).

## Hard rules

- Do not invent Blade directives, `@storefrontForm` types, `$store` keys, or design
  tokens that are not listed in `theme/docs/` or the live wiki.
- Do not add files outside the canonical surface in `theme/docs/hard-rules.md` —
  the upload validator rejects them.
